            "jpName": "スーパークリーク",
            "enName": "Super Creek",
            "jpText": "あら、トレーナーさん。\nどちらに行かれるんですか～？",
            "enText": "Oh, if it isn't Trainer. \nWhere might you be going?",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": 5684845783618215508,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "スーパークリーク",
            "enName": "Super Creek",
            "jpText": "私はお友だちと待ち合わせを\r\nしているんですが……。",
            "enText": "I'm waiting for a friend of mine, but…",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": -6114848229884116317,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "スーパークリーク",
            "enName": "Super Creek",
            "jpText": "約束を忘れて寝ていたらしくて。\nふふっ、うっかりさんですよね～。",
            "enText": "It seems they forgot we were going out \nand overslept. Hehe, they can be like \nthat sometimes.",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": -9204376495581333983,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "スーパークリーク",
            "enName": "Super Creek",
            "jpText": "1時間くらいで来るそうなので、\nのんびり待つことにします～。",
            "enText": "They said it'll take them an hour to get ready,\nso I'm just relaxing while I wait.",
            "nextBlock": -1,
